    21	results, or create one. Different milestones, customer deployments and dates within a product rollout or program
    22	retain its identity while remaining distinct theses. A shared company alone is insufficient. Local descriptions
    23	of one development may resolve to one another. Use an offered g-ID, a local t-ID, or empty for a new thread."""
    24	LOCAL_ID = {'type': 'string', 'pattern': r'^t[1-9][0-9]*$'}
