No serious actionable issues found in the proposed plan.

It keeps “a guarantee under discussion” distinct from “cash paid this year,” separates question identity from project membership, and limits conclusions to the three-article experiment. [Plan](/Users/lchingen/hivemind/docs/research/2026-10-25-extraction-continuity.md:21)

